---
/**
 * The depth runtime, as one deferred module.
 *
 * A component of its own, rendered by BaseLayout on site pages only, because
 * Astro bundles a component's script into exactly the pages that render the
 * component. The gate and the 404 never render it, so they never download
 * it. (A conditional `<script>` written inline in the layout is not safe: the
 * compiler and the bundler number inline scripts differently, and the gate
 * ended up loading this script instead of the cursor field.)
 */
---

<script>
  import { initDepth } from '~/motion/depth';

  // Depth waits for the reveal and an idle moment. Reduced motion is the
  // operating system's setting; the site has no toggle of its own.
  initDepth();
</script>
